WEBVTT

00:14:28.734 --> 00:14:30.150
and many other things.

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:31.484
So my vision is that,

00:14:31.484 --> 00:14:34.946
just like every scientist knows the word "atom,"

00:14:34.946 --> 00:14:36.913
that matter is made out of atoms,

00:14:36.913 --> 00:14:38.397
every scientist would know the words

00:14:38.397 --> 00:14:40.741
like "the cloud," saying "Yes, and,"

00:14:40.741 --> 00:14:43.820
and science will become much more creative,

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:46.824
make many, many more unexpected discoveries

00:14:46.824 --> 00:14:49.360
for the benefit of us all,

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:51.576
and would also be much more playful.

00:14:51.576 --> 00:14:54.166
And what I might ask you to remember from this talk

00:14:54.166 --> 00:14:56.862
is that next time you face

00:14:56.862 --> 00:14:58.588
a problem you can't solve

00:14:58.588 --> 00:15:01.180
in work or in life,